{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-1","name":"プロデューサー","text":"『W.I.N.G.』出場は……できないそうだ","trans":"“W.I.N.G.”的出场……看来是不行了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"7803001080010","name":"MEMちょ","text":"……うん","trans":"……嗯","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-4","name":"プロデューサー","text":"すまない、俺がもっと──","trans":"对不起，要是我能更──","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"7803001080020","name":"MEMちょ","text":"ううん\r\n違うよぉ、プロデューサー","trans":"不\n不是的啦，制作人","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"7803001080030","name":"MEMちょ","text":"プロデューサーがいたから……\r\nふたりだったから、ここまで来れたの","trans":"因为有制作人在……\n因为是我们两个人，才能走到这里","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"7803001080040","name":"MEMちょ","text":"だから、私は嬉しいよ","trans":"所以，我很开心哦","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"7803001080050","name":"MEMちょ","text":"ああ──でも──\r\n最後まで、プロデューサーと一緒に戦いたかったなぁ……","trans":"啊──不过──\n真想和制作人一起战斗到最后啊……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"7803001080060","name":"MEMちょ","text":"出たかった……──！","trans":"我想出场……──！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}